      "writtenOn": "2022-09-27T14:42:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "PTAL, GrClipSrcRectAndDstRect is gone and we\u0027re just using the original GrClipSrcRectAndDstPoint logic. The calls have been moved to higher, above GrCopyRenderTask so that we can have copy vs. copy-scaled differences in logic later on.\n\nSurfaceContext::copy() will handle clipping of the src rect to the dst, and the same goes for SurfaceFillContext::blitTexture(). But GrDrawingManager::newCopyTask and lower have been updated to require the srcRect and dstRect to be contained in the surface dimensions already.\n\nWith the next CL updating the signature of a lot of lower-level copy-related functions to be (dst, dstRect, src, srcRect), I updated the signatures of GrClipSrcRectAndDstPoint, newCopyTask etc. to follow that same convention. Call sites look a little weird now that there\u0027s still a mix of ordering conventions but that will become consistent in the next CL.",
      "parentUuid": "6a07d215_54977113",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 43,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 47,
        "endChar": 63
      },
